Enable the required observability and discovery APIs in your project: observability.googleapis.com cloudtrace.googleapis.com telemetry.googleapis.com apphub.googleapis.com apptopology.googleapis.com agentregistry.googleapis.com cloudasset.googleapis.com monitoring.googleapis.com logging.googleapis.com

Note: App Hub is the inventory that both Agent Topology and SCC AI Protection read from. It classifies your agents and catalogs your MCP servers. Without the App Hub API, neither appears.
